-> bind threshold: bound threshold
-> bind label: bound label
-> rebind threshold: bound threshold
branches: 2 next=3
    br-1 Baseline @sec-3
    br-2 Robust @sec-3  {threshold=0.99, label="robust"}
== the source a branch contributes ==
<threshold = 0.99
label = "robust"
>
a branch with no bindings contributes nothing: <>
== what a binding may not be ==
  empty name:     the name is empty
  empty value:    the value is empty
  not a name:     'a-b' is not a variable name
  leading digit:  '2x' is not a variable name
  two statements: the value must be a single expression
  fine:           []
-> bind a bad name: invalid 'a-b' is not a variable name
== the selected chain's bindings, outermost first ==
  chain: br-2 Robust
  chain: br-3 Inner
  br-2 @sec-3 threshold = 0.99
  br-2 @sec-3 label = "robust"
  br-3 @sec-1 threshold = 0.5
